# Phase Improvement Report: core

**Generated:** 2026-07-30  
**Phase:** core — API client, CLI, and Express server implementation

## Summary

| Metric | Actual | Forecast | Variance |
|--------|--------|----------|----------|
| Time (min) | 2.49 | 9.02 | -6.53 (under) |
| Cost (USD) | $0.15 | $0.28 | -$0.13 (under) |

**Over threshold:** No

All tasks completed within forecast. Phase finished significantly under budget on both time and cost.

## Findings

### 1. Model Compatibility Failure — z-ai/glm-5.1 × typescript-engineer

The `typescript-engineer` agent attempted AMSD-2041 four consecutive times using `z-ai/glm-5.1`, producing **zero tokens** on every attempt (0 tokens in, 0 tokens out). Each attempt lasted only 0.03–0.08 minutes before failing silently.

**Root cause:** The model `z-ai/glm-5.1` appears incompatible with the typescript-engineer agent's prompt format or tool-calling schema. The agent did not surface an error — it simply produced no output.

**Impact:** Wasted 4 retry cycles before the orchestrator fell back to `moonshotai/kimi-k3`, which completed the work successfully.

**Recommendation:** Add model-level health checks or token-output guards. If an agent produces zero tokens on the first attempt, skip retries with the same model and escalate to an alternate model immediately.

### 2. Forecast Overestimation for Low-Effort Stories

Both AMSD-2041 and AMSD-2041-A were forecast at ~4.5 minutes each (0.075h), but actual elapsed times were 0.91 and 1.58 minutes respectively — roughly 3–5× under forecast.

**Recommendation:** Recalibrate the forecast model for `effort: low` stories. The current multiplier appears too conservative for simple configuration changes.

### 3. Agent Role Assessment

No agentRole mismatches were detected in the core phase. The `typescript-engineer` role is appropriate for AMSD-2041 (Contentstack SDK configuration in a TypeScript/Next.js codebase).

## Corrective Actions (Future Phases)

No agentRole reassignments required. All core-phase stories have appropriate role assignments. No pending stories in future phases were found with unambiguous skill-domain mismatches.

## Action Items

- [ ] Add zero-token detection guard to agent retry loop
- [ ] Implement model-fallback chain per agent type
- [ ] Recalibrate low-effort forecast multipliers
```

